          "text": "CHU Chih-hsi 朱之錫 (T. 孟九, H. 梅麓), Jan. 26, 1624–1666, river conservancy official, was a native of I-wu, Chekiang. Becoming a chin-shih in 1646, he was soon after made a second class Hanlin compiler.",
